---
alwaysApply: true
---

# component rules

-   ALWAYS when you make a new component use `helpers/types` helpers for types of props. That types already contains a possibility of passing `data-` attrs into component, the `T` is HTMLAttributes type.
-   ALWAYS use forwardRef for components
-   reuse hooks from hooks/ folder when needed

# styling rules

-   ALWAYS style only paddings/flex/gaps in the components style file and always style borders/colors/etc in the themes/default.css
-   ALWAYS do not use classNames and use `data-` attributes selectors
